msgctxt "136"
msgid "Get out of here! We've got no money for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "We'll... We'll remember this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Thank you, Kiryu-san. We're finally rid of the thugs, thanks to you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"And the people we've taken in as bouncers have found new\r\n"
"lives at this casino."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Please accept this as a token of our gratitude. I wish we\r\n"
"could give you more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "You got <Color:8>500,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Now please, enjoy the casino."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"You either pay up, or we'll be back to rip this place to shreds! Get that "
"through your skull!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "...The hell you lookin' at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Oh... Kiryu-san... I'm sorry you had to see that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "Che succede qui?"

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Those thugs found out about our casino, and now they want us to pay "
"protection money..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"This casino was made so homeless people with nowhere else to\r\n"
"go can have a good time with what little money they have..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "We don't have any money to give to the likes of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "That is concerning..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"I wish we could have a tough guy like you do the bouncing for\r\n"
"us, but I don't want to impose on you any further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "We already owe you for taking this place back from those brats..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Nah, you don't owe me a thing. We're good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"Come to think of it, some of the homeless men who play here\r\n"
"have been talking about a couple of guys they've seen around\r\n"
"town... They say they'd make great bouncers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"A retired pro wrestler, a disgraced boxer... Men who are\r\n"
"fiery in spirit, yet their skills lie dormant, waiting for\r\n"
"just the right spark to reignite their brilliant flame..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "I hate to ask you this, but would you do me a favor?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "Cos'è?"

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Please, if you could just bring back some of those big boys to work here as "
"bouncers, we'd be eternally grateful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Sorry... But I'm gonna have to bounce on this one. As in,\r\n"
"I can't help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"I see... I'm already indebted to you as it is. Guess we'll\r\n"
"figure something out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"But if you ever change your mind and want to help, please\r\n"
"come and see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "It's a deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "All right. I'll see if I can round up a few bouncers for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Thank you! I really feel bad asking you to do this, though.\r\n"
"You've done so much for us already..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "It's no problem. So who do you want me to start with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"There's a pro wrestler who goes by the name of\r\n"
"Violence Tobita who might work out. Try him first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"I heard he hurt his back and was tossed out of the wrestling\r\n"
"federation, though he still prowls around on his own,\r\n"
"claiming he can fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "\"Violence\" Tobita, huh? Where can I find him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"I heard someone say they saw him drinking somewhere around\r\n"
"the Champion District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Got it. Wonder if he really lives up to that name..."
msgstr ""

